+            </p>
+          </div>
+        </div>
+
+        <div class="example" data-open="false">
+          <button class="question" type="button" aria-expanded="false">
+            Why do cats knead with their paws?
+            <span class="icon" aria-hidden="true">+</span>
+          </button>
+          <div class="details">
+            <p>
+              Kneading is a soothing behavior that usually comes from kittenhood.
